notes.content:
Dear Players,

Based on the collected feedback, we have made the following optimizations and fixes to the demo version and released the v1.12 update. Please update your game to get the latest version.


 Optimized screen display for certain special screen sizes;
 Fixed an issue where dialogue content was missing when mini-games were inserted during auto-dialogue;
 Updated some content on the copyright page.


If you encounter any new issues while running the game, please contact us via email at support@lspsp.me. Thank you for your support and understanding.
